## Usage Examples

### Example 1: Simple Chat Completion

**Request:**
```typescript
const response = await fetch('/api/ai/chat', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    messages: [
      { role: 'system', content: 'You are a helpful assistant.' },
      { role: 'user', content: 'What is the capital of France?' }
    ],
    model: 'openai/gpt-4-turbo'
  })
});

const data = await response.json();
console.log(data.text); // "The capital of France is Paris."
```

### Example 2: Multimodal Vision Query

**Request:**
```typescript
const response = await fetch('/api/ai/chat', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    messages: [{
      role: 'user',
      content: [
        { type: 'text', text: 'Describe this LinkedIn banner design' },
        {
          type: 'image_url',
          image_url: {
            url: 'data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANS...'
          }
        }
      ]
    }],
    model: 'google/gemini-2.0-flash-exp:free'
  })
});

const data = await response.json();
console.log(data.text);
```

### Example 3: Tool Calling (Agentic Workflow)

**Request:**
```typescript
const response = await fetch('/api/ai/chat', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    messages: [{
      role: 'user',
      content: 'Create a professional LinkedIn banner for a software engineer'
    }],
    model: 'openai/gpt-4-turbo',
    tools: [{
      type: 'function',
      function: {
        name: 'generate_image',
        description: 'Generate an image based on a text prompt',
        parameters: {
          type: 'object',
          properties: {
            prompt: { type: 'string', description: 'Image description' },
            aspectRatio: { type: 'string', enum: ['1:1', '16:9', '4:1'] }
          },
          required: ['prompt']
        }
      }
    }],
    tool_choice: 'auto'
  })
});

const data = await response.json();

// Check if model wants to call a tool
if (data.choices[0].finish_reason === 'tool_calls') {
  const toolCall = data.choices[0].message.tool_calls[0];
  console.log('Tool:', toolCall.function.name);
  console.log('Arguments:', JSON.parse(toolCall.function.arguments));

  // Execute the tool and continue conversation...
}
```

### Example 4: Conversation with History

**Request:**
```typescript
const response = await fetch('/api/ai/chat', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    messages: [
      { role: 'system', content: 'You are a brand design expert.' },
      { role: 'user', content: 'I need a LinkedIn banner' },
      { role: 'assistant', content: 'I can help! What industry are you in?' },
      { role: 'user', content: 'Technology and AI' }
    ],
    model: 'anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet'
  })
});

const data = await response.json();
console.log(data.text);
```

