## Supported Models

OpenRouter provides access to 100+ models. Popular choices:

### Reasoning Models
- `openai/gpt-5.1` - GPT-5.1 with extended reasoning
- `anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet` - Advanced reasoning and code
- `google/gemini-pro-1.5` - Long context, multimodal

### Vision Models
- `google/gemini-2.0-flash-exp:free` - Fast vision + text
- `openai/gpt-4-turbo` - GPT-4 with vision support
- `anthropic/claude-3-opus` - High-quality vision analysis

### Specialized Models
- `zhipuai/glm-4.6` - Chinese language optimized
- `minimaxai/minimax-m2` - Fast, cost-effective
- `cohere/command-r-plus` - Tool calling optimized

**Full Model List:** https://openrouter.ai/models

