## Rate Limiting

### Global AI Rate Limit

All `/api/ai/*` endpoints share a **30 requests per minute** limit per IP address.

**Implementation:**
- Sliding window rate limiter (in-memory)
- IP-based tracking
- Automatic cleanup after 1 minute

**Headers:**
```
X-RateLimit-Limit: 30
X-RateLimit-Remaining: 29
X-RateLimit-Reset: 1704067260
```

### OpenRouter Rate Limits

OpenRouter has additional provider-specific limits:
- **Free Models**: 20 requests per minute
- **Paid Models**: 60 requests per minute (with credits)
- **Burst Limit**: 100 requests per 10 seconds

**Reference:** https://openrouter.ai/docs#rate-limits

